      "summary_en": "Skarner's Attacks, Shattered Earth, Upheaval, and Impale, apply Quaking. At max stacks of Quaking, enemies take max Health magic damage over its duration.",
      "summary_zh": "斯卡纳的普通攻击、撼地、擎天和毒刺贯体都会施加战栗效果。在满层战栗时，敌人们会在其持续期间内受到最大生命值魔法伤害。",
